sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Socket as Network Socket (TCP)
    participant Uvicorn as Uvicorn (ASGI Server)
    participant Starlette as Starlette Middleware Stack
    participant CORS as CORSMiddleware
    participant Router as APIRouter (/api/v1/problems/{slug}/generate)
    participant Pydantic as Pydantic v2 Validation
    participant DI as FastAPI Dependency Injector (Depends)
    participant Endpoint as Endpoint Handler (generate_test_cases)
    participant Service as GeneratorService
    participant Engine as GenerationPipeline
    participant DB as AsyncSession (SQLAlchemy)

    Socket->>Uvicorn: Raw HTTP/1.1 or HTTP/2 Request Bytes
    Uvicorn->>Uvicorn: Parse HTTP Headers & Body
    Uvicorn->>Starlette: asgi_app(scope, receive, send)
    Starlette->>CORS: Process Origin header
    CORS-->>Starlette: Allow Origin / Add Access-Control headers

    Starlette->>Router: Match route: POST /api/v1/problems/{slug}/generate
    Router->>Pydantic: Parse and Validate request body into GenerateRequest
    alt Validation Failure (e.g. count > 20)
        Pydantic-->>Router: Raise RequestValidationError
        Router-->>Uvicorn: Serialize HTTP 422 JSON Response
        Uvicorn-->>Socket: Return 422 Unprocessable Entity
    else Validation Succeeded
        Pydantic-->>Router: Validated GenerateRequest instance
        Router->>DI: Resolve Dependencies: Depends(get_generator_service)
        DI->>DB: Open AsyncSessionLocal() via get_db_session()
        DI->>Service: Instantiate GeneratorService(session)
        DI-->>Router: Inject GeneratorService instance

        Router->>Endpoint: Call generate_test_cases(slug, request, service)
        Endpoint->>Service: service.generate_for_problem(slug, request)
        Service->>DB: SELECT Problem by slug
        DB-->>Service: Return Problem instance
        Service->>Engine: pipeline.run(slug, schema, constraints, count, ...)
        Engine-->>Service: Generated & Deduplicated Test Cases Dictionary
        Service->>DB: INSERT INTO generation_runs (status='SUCCESS', ...)
        Service-->>Endpoint: GenerateResponse Pydantic Model

        Endpoint-->>Router: Return GenerateResponse
        Router->>Pydantic: Serialize to JSON with model_validate / from_attributes
        Router->>Starlette: Build JSONResponse (HTTP 200)
        Starlette->>Uvicorn: send({'type': 'http.response.body', ...})
        DI->>DB: session.commit() and session.close()
        Uvicorn-->>Socket: Stream HTTP 200 Response Payload to Browser
    end
